  "terminal_reason": "FMCF is not transport-closed under dependent dense linear mixing. Two joint laws can have identical complete coordinate-wise characteristic functions yet different characteristic functions and ReLU means after the same dense linear observable. Any deterministic estimator carrying only marginal CF state must emit the same candidate state for both and therefore incur worst-case absolute mean error at least 1/2.",
